    {
      "bbox": [
        229,
        894,
        1752,
        1393
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "It appears that some confusion exists as to the law which governs the granting of military leaves of absence to city employees who are members of the National Guard, Naval Militia or of a federal reserve corps. The purpose of this memorandum is to summarize briefly the appropriate statutes.",
