    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        229,
        1473,
        1712,
        1976
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Two provisions of the Military Law entitle city employees who are members of the National Guard, Naval Militia or of a federal reserve corps to military leaves of absence (Mil. Law \u00a7\u00a7 43 and 245). These sections, as last amended by L. 1948 c. 201, eff. March 12, 1948, provide as follows:",
